WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.622
Use this checkpoint to test whether you understand the ideas, not just the syntax.

00:00:05.622 --> 00:00:07.897
Can you explain the row grain?

00:00:07.897 --> 00:00:11.137
Can you explain why an aggregate is required?

00:00:11.137 --> 00:00:14.867
Can you explain the difference between missing and zero?

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:21.962
Can you explain why several wide columns need a common data type when they become one long value column?

00:00:21.962 --> 00:00:28.097
And can you explain why an aggregated pivot cannot recreate the original transaction rows?
